  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Kunchanapalli Bala Nagaraju vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 1 December, 2022 Author: R. Raghunandan Rao Bench: R. Raghunandan Rao Hon'Ble Sri Justice R. Raghunandan Rao Criminal Petition No.9605 of 2022 Order:",
    "facts": "The petitioners are arrayed as accused Nos.1 to 5 in C.C.No.131 of 2020 on the file of the First Additional Junior Civil Judge at Narasaraopet, Palnadu District, for offences under Sections 188, 272, 273 & 420 of Indian Penal Code and Sections 58, 59 & 63 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 on the ground that the petitioners were caught by storing tobacco and tobacco products. 2. The cases are being booked against persons, who are found to be either storing or transporting tobacco or tobacco products in the State of Andhra Pradesh. Persons, who are facing such cases, have been approaching this Court for relief.",
